<main><section class="section split"><div><p class="eyebrow">Our Story</p><h3 class="page-title">A home for authentic faith, hope, and love.</h3></div><div class="prose"><p>Mahanaim Christian Church began with a vision to build a home where every person could experience authentic faith, hope, and love. MCC serves local and global communities by proclaiming the good news of Jesus Christ and nurturing people through worship, teaching, and service.</p><p>We believe in one God: Father, Son, and Holy Spirit. We uphold the Bible as the inspired Word of God. Our mission is to love God and love people through prayer, discipleship, fellowship, and acts of compassion.</p><div class="story-video-placeholder"><div><span>Video Coming Soon</span><h3>Our Story in Motion</h3><p>A church story video will be added here when it is ready.</p></div></div></div></section></main><script is:inline src="../scripts/main.js?v=20260609-map"></script></body></html>
